{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n 自撮りが下手な私のために\n めいめいが自撮りを教えてくれました！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFMZRACFZ7C84JQK6EB937","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n これはタイマーで撮ってます⏲\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN0QX1NF8P12J6TD7XT3C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN1QR8EKCAG9NMG0CFRHZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN2Q4YZCQ73582BBPN7WW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 顎に手を置いて\n 顔に角度を付けて\n アイドルになりきって！\n というめいめいのアドバイス！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN3MPGJVS3XH7V7FA1PRQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n なりきれてますか？\n \n めいめい可愛い〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN4KACBT4177D9AQ1109F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n なんか可愛いポーズを！\n というめいめいのアドバイス\n \n 色々アドバイスしてくれて\n とにかく可愛い！！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN5N6WA75MVSJF41XF1QQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 次は何か可愛いものを持ってみよう〜\n ということでお茶！\n \n \n 笑笑笑笑\n \n \n めいめい優秀な先生👩‍🏫\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN6N0NT45FR6GHA019MZB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n もっと可愛いものをって事で\n 鏡を貸してくれたよ！\n \n だから私の地味な鏡を\n めいめいに貸したよ！\n \n そして\n 顔を傾けて\n いい角度をみつけて！\n というアドバイスも！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN7KHX57EXR7BWRCR7ZFD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n いっぱい傾けたら\n めいめいが爆笑してました（笑）\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN8JNB6TT9WFYE8VN6TJ2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFN9HNXRQH9FFZDW9PF7HY","alt":